{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/lulworth-firing-notice/lulworth-november-2026-firing-times","content_id":"125ad894-9701-4f16-a578-e9ffefe60173","description":null,"details":{"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><h2 id=\"firing-times-for-november-2026\">Firing times for November 2026:</h2>\n\n<p>These are the standard firing times subject to operational requirement extensions:</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"lulworth-range-complex\">Lulworth Range Complex</h2>\n\n<p>2 to 8 November 2026:</p>\n\n<table>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 5pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Tuesday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 4pm and 6pm to 11:59pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Wednesday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 5pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Thursday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 4pm and 6pm to 11:59pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Friday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 12:30pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Saturday:</td>\n      <td>N/A</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sunday:</td>\n      <td>N/A</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>9 to 15 November 2026:</p>\n\n<table>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 5pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Tuesday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 4pm and 6pm to 11:59pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Wednesday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 5pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Thursday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 4pm and 6pm to 11:59pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Friday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 5pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Saturday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 4pm and 6pm to 11:59pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sunday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 1pm</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>16 to 29 November 2026:</p>\n\n<table>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 5pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Tuesday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 4pm and 6pm to 11:59pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Wednesday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 5pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Thursday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 4pm and 6pm to 11:59pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Friday:</td>\n      <td>9:30am to 12:30pm</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Saturday:</td>\n      <td>N/A</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sunday:</td>\n      <td>N/A</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 id=\"note-airspace-remains-closed-for-duration-as-per-aip\">Note: Airspace remains closed for duration as per AIP</h3>\n\n<h2 id=\"your-safety\">Your safety</h2>\n\n<div class=\"call-to-action\">\n  <p>Danger - when warning signals are displayed, regardless of the timings, do not cross the range boundary.</p>\n\n  <p>Warning signals are red flags by day and red lamps by night; range boundaries are marked by red and white poles.</p>\n\n  <p>Red flags and red lamps indicate that live firing is taking place within the range boundaries.</p>\n\n  <p>Do not enter the danger area when in use, this could result in loss of life.</p>\n\n  <p>Do not touch any military debris, it may be dangerous. Please note the location and inform a Training Safety Officer (TSO) via 07970 228400, 07971 708553 or the police.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>Learn more about <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/safe-access\">accessing MOD training areas safely</a> safely.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/public-access-to-military-areas\">Public access to military land</a></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"site-specific-notes\">Site specific notes</h3>\n\n<p>There is restricted access to Lulworth Range Complex, it’s danger areas and associated military roads during the following:</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"public-access\">Public access</h2>\n\n<h3 id=\"lulworth-range-walks-access\">Lulworth Range walks access</h3>\n\n<p>2 to 8 November 2026:</p>\n\n<table>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monday:</td>\n      <td>No access</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Tuesday:</td>\n      <td>No access</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Wednesday:</td>\n      <td>No access</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Thursday:</td>\n      <td>No access</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Friday:</td>\n      <td>Open 4:30pm onwards</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Saturday:</td>\n      <td>Open</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sunday:</td>\n      <td>Open</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>9 to 15 November 2026:</p>\n\n<table>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monday:</td>\n      <td>No access</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Tuesday:</td>\n      <td>No access</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Wednesday:</td>\n      <td>No access</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Thursday:</td>\n      <td>No access</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Friday:</td>\n      <td>No access</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Saturday:</td>\n      <td>No access</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sunday:</td>\n      <td>No access</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>16 to 29 November 2026:</p>\n\n<table>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monday:</td>\n      <td>No access</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Tuesday:</td>\n      <td>No access</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Wednesday:</td>\n      <td>No access</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Thursday:</td>\n      <td>No access</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Friday:</td>\n      <td>Open 4:30pm onwards</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Saturday:</td>\n      <td>Open</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sunday:</td>\n      <td>Open</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 id=\"tyneham-church-school-and-village-gate-access\">Tyneham Church, school and village gate access</h3>\n\n<p>2 to 8 November 2026:</p>\n\n<table>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Monday:</td>\n      <td>No access</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Tuesday:</td>\n      <td>No access</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Wednesday:</td>\n      <td>No access</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Thursday:</td>\n      <td>No access</td>\n    </tr>\n 